                "type": "paragraph",
                "version": 1
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "detail": 0,
                    "format": 0,
                    "mode": "normal",
                    "style": "",
                    "text": "Dance and visual art exist as intertwined practices, each feeding the other's physicality and emotional language. Alongside installation exhibitions, she continues to perform professionally, with live performance occasionally integrated into exhibition contexts.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "version": 1
                  }
                ],
